{"name":"Embarrassed Frog","hex":"#996611","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"embarrassed","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a feeling of shameful discomfort.","Impeded; obstructed; in an awkward situation."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of embarrass"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/embarrassed"},{"term":"frog","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of a class of small tailless amphibians of the order Anura that typically hop.","A member of this class that is not a toad."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To hunt or trap frogs.","To use a pronged plater to transfer (cells) to another plate."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/frog"}],"entries":[{"title":"Embarrassment","blocks":[{"text":"Embarrassment or awkwardness is an emotional state that is associated with mild to severe levels of discomfort, and which is usually experienced when someone commits a socially unacceptable, or frowned-upon act that is witnessed by or revealed to others. Frequently grouped with shame and guilt embarrassment is considered a \"self-conscious emotion\", and it can have a profoundly negative impact on a person's thoughts or behavior."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Embarrassed_woman.jpg/330px-Embarrassed_woman.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Embarrassment"},{"title":"Frog","blocks":[{"text":"A frog is any member of a diverse and largely semiaquatic group of short-bodied, tailless amphibian vertebrates composing the order Anura. Frog species with rough skin texture due to wart-like parotoid glands tend to be called toads, but the distinction between frogs and toads is informal and purely cosmetic, and does not reflect taxonomy or evolutionary history."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Red-eyed_Leaf_Frog_%2849661076226%29.jpg/330px-Red-eyed_Leaf_Frog_%2849661076226%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frog"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg/500px-Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg/1280px-Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg/500px-Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An embarrassing proposal by Antoine Watteau","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAntoine_Watteau_014.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Distribution.anura.1.png/500px-Distribution.anura.1.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Distribution.anura.1.png/1280px-Distribution.anura.1.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Distribution.anura.1.png/500px-Distribution.anura.1.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADistribution.anura.1.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Anoures.jpg/500px-Anoures.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Anoures.jpg/1280px-Anoures.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Anoures.jpg/500px-Anoures.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=p